  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだを　おおう　がんじょうな　カラが\nてきの　こうげきを　はじきかえし\nするどい　トゲで　はんげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸을 둘러싼 단단한 껍질이\n적의 공격을 튕겨내고\n날카로운 가시로 반격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La carapace qui recouvre son corps le protège\ndes attaques adverses, et ses piquants lui permettent\nde contre-attaquer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Panzer, der seinen Körper umgibt, bietet ihm\nSchutz vor Angreifern und straft direkte Angriffe\npostwendend mit spitzen Stacheln ab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desvía los ataques de los enemigos con la robusta\ncoraza que cubre su cuerpo y contraataca con sus\ndos afilados cuernos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Respinge gli attacchi dei nemici grazie al guscio che\ngli ricopre il corpo e contrattacca con gli aculei affilati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It relies on its sturdy shell to deflect predators’\nattacks. It counterattacks with its sharp quills.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体を　覆う　頑丈な　殻が\n敵の　攻撃を　弾き返し\n鋭い　トゲで　反撃する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desvía los ataques de los enemigos con la robusta\ncoraza que cubre su cuerpo y contraataca con sus\ndos afilados cuernos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なかまどうしで　からだを　ぶつけあい\nあしこしを　きたえる。じぶんからは\nたたかわない　やさしい　せいかく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "동료끼리 몸을 서로 부딪쳐\n하반신을 단련한다. 자신이 먼저\n싸움을 걸지 않는 온순한 성격이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il renforce ses membres inférieurs en se ruant\nviolemment sur ses congénères. Naturellement\npaisible, il ne provoque jamais un combat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie stärken ihre Beinmuskeln, indem sie sich\ngegenseitig anrempeln. Sie sind sehr freundlich\nund würden niemals einen Streit anfangen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chocan contra sus congéneres para fortalecer sus\npiernas. Debido a su carácter afable, nunca son los\nque provocan un combate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Allena la parte inferiore del corpo scontrandosi con i\nsuoi simili. Ha una natura mite e non inizia mai\nuna lotta per primo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They strengthen their lower bodies by\nrunning into one another. They are very\nkind and won’t start fights.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
