      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "受到了結實外殼的保護，但因為外殼極為沉重，自然而然也鍛鍊了下盤。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une carapace solide le protège. Elle est si lourde qu’elle a permis à ses membres inférieurs de se muscler naturellement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein robuster Panzer bietet ihm Schutz. Da er auch enorm schwer ist, sind Igastarnishs Beine von Natur aus gut trainiert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lo protege una robusta coraza que, al ser tan pesada, le proporciona al mismo tiempo una forma natural de fortalecer las piernas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo robusto guscio è molto pesante e, oltre a proteggerlo, sottopone la parte inferiore del suo corpo a un costante allenamento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s protected by a sturdy shell. The shell is also very heavy, which naturally strengthens Quilladin’s lower body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頑丈な　殻で　守られるがずっしりと　重たいので　自然と足腰が　鍛えられるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
